              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Update integrity: Portable artifact unsigned. Categories: Insufficient update authenticity, Update integrity. Weaknesses: CWE-494."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Update integrity: Portable artifact unsigned. Categories: Insufficient update authenticity, Update integrity. Weaknesses: CWE-494.\n\n## Remediation\n\n\u4ee5embedded public key\u9a57\u8b49portable artifact\u53caversion metadata signature\u3002\n\n\u4ee5embedded public key\u9a57\u8b49portable artifact\u8207metadata signature\u3002\n\n\u4ee5\u65e2\u6709Tauri signing key\u6216\u5c08\u7528offline key\u5c0dportable ZIP\u8207version metadata\u7c3d\u7ae0\uff0c\u5c07verification public key\u7de8\u5165application\uff1b\u7c3d\u7f72\u5167\u5bb9\u7d81\u5b9aversion\u3001asset name\u3001digest\u53carelease channel\uff0c\u7f3a\u7c3d\u7ae0\u6216rollback\u4e00\u5f8b\u62d2\u7d55\u3002",
                "text": "Update integrity: Portable artifact unsigned. Categories: Insufficient update authenticity, Update integrity. Weaknesses: CWE-494.\n\nRemediation:\n\n\u4ee5embedded public key\u9a57\u8b49portable artifact\u53caversion metadata signature\u3002\n\n\u4ee5embedded public key\u9a57\u8b49portable artifact\u8207metadata signature\u3002\n\n\u4ee5\u65e2\u6709Tauri signing key\u6216\u5c08\u7528offline key\u5c0dportable ZIP\u8207version metadata\u7c3d\u7ae0\uff0c\u5c07verification public key\u7de8\u5165application\uff1b\u7c3d\u7f72\u5167\u5bb9\u7d81\u5b9aversion\u3001asset name\u3001digest\u53carelease channel\uff0c\u7f3a\u7c3d\u7ae0\u6216rollback\u4e00\u5f8b\u62d2\u7d55\u3002"
              },
